OL,3,GNEWSASouthern road closes to fell
OL,4,Astorm-damaged trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road in the south of the Isle of Man
OL,7,Fis closing so trees damaged in recent
OL,8,Fstorms can be felled.
OL,10,FThe A3 Ramsey to Castletown Road will
OL,11,Fbe shut from 09:30 GMT until 16:00 from
OL,12,Fthe junction with the Silverdale Road
OL,13,Fin Malew.
OL,15,FThe Department of Infrastructure (DOI)
OL,16,Fsaid the work was being carried out by
OL,17,Fa contractor for a private landowner.
OL,19,FIt added that the roadside trees were
OL,20,F"destabilised in the recent stormy
OL,21,Fweather".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
